{"font_size": 0.4, "font_color": "#FFFFFF", "background_alpha": 0.5, "background_color": "#9C27B0", "Stroke": "none", "type": "AIsubtitle", "lang": "zh", "version": "eng-1.2.0-Index-johns-pen-lite", "body": [{"content": "大家好，今天我们来聊聊反应追踪", "from": 0.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 1, "to": 5.72}, {"content": "上周我们讨论了平滑追踪", "from": 5.72, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 2, "to": 8.44}, {"content": "更早之前我们讲过静态和动态点击", "from": 8.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 3, "to": 12.04}, {"content": "如果你错过了那些视频", "from": 12.04, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 4, "to": 13.66}, {"content": "请务必查看之前的章节", "from": 13.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 5, "to": 16.41}, {"content": "那么什么是反应追踪", "from": 16.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 6, "to": 19.17}, {"content": "与平滑追踪不同的是", "from": 19.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 7, "to": 22.13}, {"content": "目标移动速度非常快", "from": 22.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 8, "to": 23.92}, {"content": "我们也称这为短连杆", "from": 23.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 9, "to": 27.22}, {"content": "平滑瞄准通常被称为长连杆", "from": 27.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 10, "to": 30.61}, {"content": "机器人的动作非常 erratic", "from": 30.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 11, "to": 32.93}, {"content": "与平滑追踪不同的是", "from": 32.93, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 12, "to": 34.59}, {"content": "反应追踪中机器人的动作难以预测", "from": 34.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 13, "to": 39.87}, {"content": "机器人仍然保持相同形状", "from": 39.87, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 14, "to": 41.83}, {"content": "因此主要呈现为大或小球体", "from": 41.83, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 15, "to": 45.53}, {"content": "嗯", "from": 45.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 16, "to": 46.23}, {"content": "或者在药片形状中进行反应追踪", "from": 46.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 17, "to": 49.21}, {"content": "这不是关于预测", "from": 49.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 18, "to": 50.49}, {"content": "而是关于即时反应", "from": 50.49, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 19, "to": 51.81}, {"content": "因此你的反应速度非常重要", "from": 51.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 20, "to": 54.83}, {"content": "这是最难的追踪形式", "from": 54.83, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 21, "to": 57.53}, {"content": "你的命中率会较低", "from": 57.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 22, "to": 60.06}, {"content": "这种追踪在《Apex英雄》等游戏中最为常见", "from": 60.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 23, "to": 64.039}, {"content": "嗯", "from": 64.039, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 24, "to": 64.599}, {"content": "反应追踪也在《Quake》和《守望先锋》等游戏中存在", "from": 64.599, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 25, "to": 71.17}, {"content": "为什么要提升反应追踪能力", "from": 71.33, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 26, "to": 74.69}, {"content": "反应追踪能有效提升你的预判能力", "from": 74.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 27, "to": 79.35}, {"content": "正如我之前所说", "from": 79.35, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 28, "to": 80.83}, {"content": "在动态机器人场景中", "from": 80.83, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 29, "to": 82.27}, {"content": "预判能力意味着预判机器人的移动轨迹", "from": 82.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 30, "to": 86.38}, {"content": "理解目标下一步会去往何处", "from": 86.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 31, "to": 90.28}, {"content": "当它进行转向或移动时", "from": 90.28, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 32, "to": 93.27}, {"content": "因此你的反应速度至关重要", "from": 93.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 33, "to": 96.31}, {"content": "反应追踪极其困难", "from": 96.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 34, "to": 99.169}, {"content": "在我做基准测试时", "from": 99.409, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 35, "to": 101.189}, {"content": "我经常特别提到空中场景堪称噩梦", "from": 101.189, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 36, "to": 107.41}, {"content": "当我开始玩Kovacs时", "from": 107.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 37, "to": 109.53}, {"content": "我发现反应追踪最难掌握", "from": 109.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 38, "to": 112.84}, {"content": "所以我花了很多时间提升反应追踪", "from": 112.84, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 39, "to": 117.53}, {"content": "当我玩了大约一年后", "from": 117.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 40, "to": 119.33}, {"content": "我在Rex Rays中获得了一级排名", "from": 119.33, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 41, "to": 121.81}, {"content": "Kata和Kata", "from": 121.81, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 42, "to": 123.73}, {"content": "我看到快速光线", "from": 123.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 43, "to": 125.52}, {"content": "即使我获得了这些一级排名", "from": 125.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 44, "to": 128.22}, {"content": "像地面广场和空中这样的复杂场景", "from": 128.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 45, "to": 132.11}, {"content": "我仍经常感到困难", "from": 132.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 46, "to": 135.01}, {"content": "尽管我在基准测试中达到Astra级反应追踪", "from": 135.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 47, "to": 139.48}, {"content": "反应追踪有时会让你感觉", "from": 139.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 48, "to": 143.13}, {"content": "自己极其不擅长", "from": 143.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 49, "to": 144.79}, {"content": "原因在于大多数场景", "from": 144.79, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 50, "to": 146.57}, {"content": "即使是第一名的成绩准确率也非常低", "from": 146.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 51, "to": 150.82}, {"content": "所以你需要放弃自己在这方面非常糟糕的想法", "from": 150.82, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 52, "to": 155.1}, {"content": "但仅仅因为准确率低", "from": 155.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 53, "to": 158.17}, {"content": "这很正常", "from": 158.73, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 54, "to": 160.07}, {"content": "在第一次尝试困难的反应追踪场景时准确率可能低于百分之二十", "from": 160.07, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 55, "to": 166.76}, {"content": "总的来说", "from": 166.76, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 56, "to": 167.74}, {"content": "反应追踪是瞄准技巧的重要基础", "from": 167.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 57, "to": 172.02}, {"content": "尤其是对于玩追踪类游戏的玩家来说", "from": 172.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 58, "to": 175.16}, {"content": "比如《Apex英雄》或《守望先锋》", "from": 175.16, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 59, "to": 177.79}, {"content": "嗯", "from": 177.91, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 60, "to": 178.33}, {"content": "你进行的反应追踪场景会更加困难", "from": 178.33, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 61, "to": 182.66}, {"content": "实际游戏场景中的目标移动更快更无序", "from": 182.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 62, "to": 187.8}, {"content": "但这对真实游戏训练非常有效", "from": 187.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 63, "to": 190.96}, {"content": "能让实战瞄准更容易", "from": 190.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 64, "to": 195.14}, {"content": "那么反应追踪场景的最佳设置是什么", "from": 195.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 65, "to": 200.019}, {"content": "大多数人使用2到4厘米/360的灵敏度进行追踪训练", "from": 200.139, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 66, "to": 206.199}, {"content": "《守望先锋》中通常设置为103度视野和40-50厘米/360", "from": 206.199, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 67, "to": 212.179}, {"content": "这是最低限度", "from": 212.179, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 68, "to": 214.039}, {"content": "同时也是普遍使用的标准视野", "from": 214.039, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 69, "to": 219.32}, {"content": "我使用10.3度视野", "from": 219.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 70, "to": 220.54}, {"content": "《守望先锋》中49.5厘米/360灵敏度", "from": 220.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 71, "to": 225.48}, {"content": "这是我的默认设置", "from": 225.48, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 72, "to": 226.66}, {"content": "《守望先锋》3.5点灵敏度", "from": 226.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 73, "to": 228.0}, {"content": "搭配800DPI", "from": 228.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 74, "to": 229.8}, {"content": "我每个场景都使用这个设置从不更改", "from": 229.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 75, "to": 233.89}, {"content": "选择最适合你的", "from": 233.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 76, "to": 236.19}, {"content": "或你希望达到的训练目标", "from": 236.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 77, "to": 238.31}, {"content": "现在谈谈技巧", "from": 239.51, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 78, "to": 241.51}, {"content": "我在玩反应追踪场景时的技巧", "from": 241.51, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 79, "to": 244.99}, {"content": "始终保持在目标正中央", "from": 244.99, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 80, "to": 247.45}, {"content": "当艾米", "from": 247.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 81, "to": 248.59}, {"content": "我之前提到过", "from": 248.59, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 82, "to": 250.23}, {"content": "在平滑追踪视频中", "from": 250.23, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 83, "to": 251.89}, {"content": "我不是边缘追踪玩家", "from": 251.89, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 84, "to": 254.779}, {"content": "始终保持在目标中心", "from": 254.779, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 85, "to": 257.36}, {"content": "尽量避免左右急甩", "from": 257.36, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 86, "to": 260.6}, {"content": "这在初次尝试时会频繁发生", "from": 260.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 87, "to": 266.37}, {"content": "如果发现频繁急甩", "from": 266.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 88, "to": 269.49}, {"content": "尝试更简单的场景版本", "from": 269.49, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 89, "to": 272.31}, {"content": "首先", "from": 272.31, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 90, "to": 273.65}, {"content": "尽量保持瞄准流畅", "from": 274.52, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 91, "to": 277.6}, {"content": "这需要大量练习", "from": 277.6, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 92, "to": 279.54}, {"content": "同时具备良好的目标预判能力", "from": 279.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 93, "to": 282.27}, {"content": "应对反应目标应如同追踪平滑移动目标", "from": 282.27, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 94, "to": 288.53}, {"content": "不要试图预测", "from": 288.53, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 95, "to": 290.4}, {"content": "只需平稳反应", "from": 290.4, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 96, "to": 294.4}, {"content": "不要紧张死死攥住鼠标", "from": 294.4, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 97, "to": 298.21}, {"content": "观察目标并预判目标", "from": 298.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 98, "to": 300.57}, {"content": "而不是瞄准线", "from": 300.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 99, "to": 301.69}, {"content": "匹配目标速度避免过度急甩", "from": 301.69, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 100, "to": 307.37}, {"content": "短距离随机场景中的动作通常非常快", "from": 307.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 101, "to": 311.45}, {"content": "左右移动", "from": 311.45, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 102, "to": 312.57}, {"content": "不要全程过度甩杆", "from": 312.57, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 103, "to": 314.63}, {"content": "左右移动", "from": 314.63, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 104, "to": 315.37}, {"content": "保持修正幅度小且精准", "from": 315.37, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 105, "to": 318.19}, {"content": "你不知道下一朵花会往哪个方向走", "from": 318.19, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 106, "to": 321.11}, {"content": "这就是我主张的观点", "from": 321.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 107, "to": 323.13}, {"content": "瞄准重心比边缘追踪更好", "from": 323.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 108, "to": 327.22}, {"content": "但这完全是个人偏好", "from": 327.22, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 109, "to": 329.24}, {"content": "如果你更喜欢边缘追踪也完全没问题", "from": 329.24, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 110, "to": 333.13}, {"content": "存在不同类型的反应追踪场景", "from": 333.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 111, "to": 337.1}, {"content": "如果我们从基准测试开始", "from": 337.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 112, "to": 339.28}, {"content": "首先有空中对空", "from": 339.28, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 113, "to": 342.54}, {"content": "这个炮台会以极快的速度进行水平和垂直移动", "from": 342.54, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 114, "to": 348.95}, {"content": "零散的动作", "from": 348.95, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 115, "to": 350.29}, {"content": "还有短距离横移", "from": 350.29, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 116, "to": 352.32}, {"content": "也有广场场景", "from": 352.32, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 117, "to": 354.4}, {"content": "或称为地面广场", "from": 354.4, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 118, "to": 356.8}, {"content": "这是一种类似药丸的Boss，也会进行短距离横移且仅水平移动", "from": 356.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 119, "to": 363.61}, {"content": "这两种场景属于关卡场景", "from": 363.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 120, "to": 366.98}, {"content": "在最新基准测试中", "from": 366.98, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 121, "to": 368.74}, {"content": "它们仅持续一分钟", "from": 368.74, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 122, "to": 370.06}, {"content": "但过去会持续多分钟", "from": 370.06, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 123, "to": 373.18}, {"content": "仍包含五种不同类型的机器人", "from": 373.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 124, "to": 376.92}, {"content": "每个Boss有自己的移动模式", "from": 376.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 125, "to": 380.38}, {"content": "如果你想在这些场景中获得特定排名", "from": 380.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 126, "to": 384.8}, {"content": "并且卡在某个Boss上无法突破", "from": 384.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 127, "to": 387.68}, {"content": "可以单独练习这些机器人", "from": 387.68, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 128, "to": 392.38}, {"content": "只需输入场景名称", "from": 392.38, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 129, "to": 394.96}, {"content": "会出现名为Bot 1的场景", "from": 394.96, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 130, "to": 397.18}, {"content": "Bot 2或Bot 3", "from": 397.18, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 131, "to": 399.3}, {"content": "这就是我的建议", "from": 400.26, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 132, "to": 402.0}, {"content": "或者如果你想提升这些场景的能力", "from": 402.0, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 133, "to": 405.08}, {"content": "还有XYZ伏打场景", "from": 405.44, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 134, "to": 409.4}, {"content": "这是一个类似空中移动的炮台", "from": 409.4, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 135, "to": 412.78}, {"content": "但移动极其零散", "from": 412.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 136, "to": 415.16}, {"content": "还会像《守望先锋》的闪现一样瞬移", "from": 415.16, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 137, "to": 420.22}, {"content": "还有近战快速横移和快速狭窄横移场景", "from": 420.42, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 138, "to": 424.7}, {"content": "但这些不在基准测试中", "from": 424.7, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 139, "to": 427.9}, {"content": "这就是我推荐的提升反应追踪技巧的方法", "from": 428.02, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 140, "to": 432.8}, {"content": "再次附上由伏打社区整理的最佳场景表格", "from": 432.8, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 141, "to": 437.92}, {"content": "适用于反应追踪", "from": 437.92, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 142, "to": 441.58}, {"content": "你可以自行选择场景", "from": 441.58, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 143, "to": 445.1}, {"content": "我建议始终包含空中类场景", "from": 445.1, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 144, "to": 450.21}, {"content": "广场类场景和XYZ类场景", "from": 450.21, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 145, "to": 455.01}, {"content": "这三种最难且能带来最大进步", "from": 455.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 146, "to": 460.08}, {"content": "当你反复练习时", "from": 460.08, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 147, "to": 462.46}, {"content": "在播放列表方面", "from": 462.9, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 148, "to": 464.46}, {"content": "我确实有一个推荐", "from": 464.46, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 149, "to": 466.61}, {"content": "那就是伏打制作的专项反应追踪播放列表", "from": 466.61, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 150, "to": 472.41}, {"content": "这就是本期关于反应追踪视频的全部内容，一如既往", "from": 472.41, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 151, "to": 477.01}, {"content": "如果你有任何问题", "from": 477.01, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 152, "to": 478.55}, {"content": "欢迎在下方留言评论", "from": 478.55, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 153, "to": 481.11}, {"content": "我会尽力为你解答", "from": 481.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 154, "to": 483.09}, {"content": "你也可以访问我的Twitch频道", "from": 483.09, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 155, "to": 486.17}, {"content": "在Twitch.tv/vale_下", "from": 486.17, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 156, "to": 489.66}, {"content": "下周我们将继续讲解目标切换", "from": 489.66, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 157, "to": 492.78}, {"content": "如果你期待这一内容", "from": 492.78, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 158, "to": 495.13}, {"content": "请订阅并为本视频点赞", "from": 495.13, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 159, "to": 498.11}, {"content": "如果对你有帮助的话", "from": 498.11, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 160, "to": 499.68}, {"content": "祝你在瞄准训练中一切顺利", "from": 499.88, "location": 2, "music": 0.0, "sid": 161, "to": 5